        <div class="questions">
          <h3>What we still don't know</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Who built the reservoir, and whether it began as a spring, a stream, or a wet meadow.</li>
            <li>Whether 20 Stafford Place is the original estate house.</li>
            <li>When the residents finished buying the lake, and when the club took the name Lakenridge.</li>
            <li>Any photograph of the pond taken before 1940.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
